author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Inspect the failing hosted log and full integration test; set a bounded realistic Windows test budget without suppressing assertions; rerun focused integration and full nightly matrix; retain exact coverage gate
goal: project management = context management
objective: Nightly merge receipt validation distinguishes test duration from failed receipt behavior
value: Keep nightly Windows release evidence reliable
