comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T01:51:53.623Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status pm search for merge receipt health timeout and Windows nightly test timeout found historical pm-baksix, pm-25b7tg and pm-kvhnb5, but no owner of this exact merge-receipt classification 60-second hosted timeout. Separate from the bundled init timeout in pm-kvhnb5."
  "2026-09-28T01:53:19.569Z","harness:codex","Nightly run 36366344450 at ca3d4d788: Windows Node 24 shard 1/2 reported 4428 passed, 105 skipped and one 60000 ms timeout in the full lossless receipt settlement test at line 504. Other six nightly jobs, including Windows shard 2/2 and exact coverage, passed. This one test runs many real CLI and Git operations, so its 120000 ms limit remains bounded while allowing hosted contention."
  "2026-09-28T02:18:54.030Z","harness:codex",Focused real merge-receipt classification suite passed 5/5 in 24.1 seconds locally with the 120-second bounded test limit. Full exact coverage passed 9384 tests at 100/100/100/100; hosted Windows shard rerun is pending. Graph composition initially found two missing prose edges and passed after typed links to original test owner pm-baksix and prior Windows timeout pm-25b7tg were added.
